<title>SWITZERLAND: CSFB tips Nestle, underweights banks.</title>
<headline>CSFB tips Nestle, underweights banks.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Suisse First Boston recommended adding to long positions in Nestle SA and said Roche and Novartis would outperform the Swiss market, but advised underweighting banks and insurers.</p>
<p>&quot;Cyclical stocks continue the uptrend which started in August 1996 and have further potential. Add on weakness,&quot; it said in a technical research report released on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
